{"id":"tikho","lemma":"тихо","pos":"adv","rank":471,"glosses":["quietly, softly, gently, faintly, silently","quietly, calmly, peacefully","slowly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%85%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%85%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Они тихо говорили.","en":"They talked quietly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926853","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Почему так тихо?","en":"Why is it so quiet?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Всё тихо.","en":"All is quiet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/72462","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Сделай это тихо.","en":"Do it quietly.","words":[{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Здесь очень тихо.","en":"It's very quiet here.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"very"},null]}]}